  introLines:
  - Oh! A visitor. How lovely. Mind the blood.
  - I've made myself quite comfortable in this body. The heart is SUCH a lovely room.
  - Make yourself at home. I did.
  finalDefeatLine: NO... YOU UNDERSTOOD THE SYSTEM!
  hintTaunts:
  - Arteries go AWAY, darling. A for away. Honestly.
  - 'Right side of the heart: used blood, to the LUNGS. Did no one tell you?'
  teachingLines:
  - '*sigh* Very well. A tour of the facilities.'
  - Trace the blood with your finger. Body, right heart, lungs, left heart, body.
    Round and round.
  - There. Now you understand my house better than I do. How annoying.
  rematchLine: SHOW ME WHAT YOU LEARNED.
